, "text": "Every board draws the same surfaces: a window (title bar, close, tabs, search, dropdown, buttons, table, scrollbar, footer), a LibKa0s settings canvas (nav rail, heading, checkboxes, slider, dropdown, colour swatch, drawer), a confirm dialog, a tooltip and a HUD meter. Skins reach the HUD too: each HUD style setting defaults to 'From skin', and a value the user sets wins.", "fill": "gray"}}, "designSystems": []}